        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T01:05:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Augh, I'm sad I didn't get the chance to do this. I got swamped with stuff to do, but I still like this challenge. When I've got some free time, I'll still get some photos of her in the places, like the coffee shop or next to a blue car.</p><p>In fact, I like this \"challenge\", and I'd like to keep it going. Anyone in favor of keeping this going by giving a task of taking a photo of a certain character in a certain place, and whoever fulfills the requirement picks the next location?</p>",
