        "id": 80610,
        "name": "Oaktree",
        "username": "Oaktree",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T01:12:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I might see what I can do. I take walks all the time around where I live and carry an iPhone (and often my \"good\" camera - a decent Nikon).&nbsp; Carrying a Wraith card on these for adding to photos might be an interesting adjunct.&nbsp; Especially for some stuff in the local small parks.&nbsp; If someone else starts doing this I suggest having the card sleeved, and possibly carrying some tape of temporary adhesive so that it will be easier to \"pose\" the card for a particularly good sneaky photo.</p>",
