        "id": 80613,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T01:48:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>evandan55 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Augh, I'm sad I didn't get the chance to do this. I got swamped with stuff to do, but I still like this challenge. When I've got some free time, I'll still get some photos of her in the places, like the coffee shop or next to a blue car.In fact, I like this \"challenge\", and I'd like to keep it going. Anyone in favor of keeping this going by giving a task of taking a photo of a certain character in a certain place, and whoever fulfills the requirement picks the next location?</blockquote></div>\nGreat idea. Let's do this! \n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes! I love it. Great idea!</p>\n<p>I'm going to challenge myself to get AA in an appropriately musical location. I'm singing with my choirs in a concert on Saturday with an orchestra, so there should be plenty of opportunity there.</p>\n<p>I'm still planning to photograph Wraith, I just haven't gotten round to it yet, unfortunately.</p>",
