        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T04:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's add some score to this.</p><p>You get +2 points every goal you achieve. If you're not the first person to complete the challenge, you only get +1 for completing the goal. You cannot score on your own challenges.</p><p>I'll start with this example, at Silverleaf's suggestion.</p><p>1) Argent Adept next to a musical instrument.</p><p>EDIT: Removed part about \"bonus\" challenges. Feel like finding extra bonuses would have been too much of a stretch for som heroes. Just one challenge per post.</p>",
